1
00:00:00,662 --> 00:00:01,952
(Leonard:)No, no, no.

2
00:00:02,122 --> 00:00:04,832
(Penny:)Never mind. Never mind.
That's not important.

3
00:00:05,542 --> 00:00:06,962
(Penny:)Sheldon, this was big of you.

4
00:00:07,127 --> 00:00:09,627
(Penny:)- Thank you. I really appreciate it.
- Thank you.

5
00:00:10,255 --> 00:00:12,845
- Good night, Sheldon.
- Penny?

6
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:14,548
(Sheldon:)Yes?

7
00:00:14,759 --> 00:00:16,599
(Sheldon:)Well played.

8
00:00:19,389 --> 00:00:21,519
(Penny:)- Thank you.
- Just remember...

9
00:00:21,683 --> 00:00:25,433
...with great power
comes great responsibility.

10
00:00:27,564 --> 00:00:29,394
(Penny:)Understood.

11
00:00:37,866 --> 00:00:39,406
[DOORBELL RINGS]

12
00:00:44,414 --> 00:00:45,664
Can I help you?

13
00:00:45,832 --> 00:00:48,502
Yes, we're here to fix the cable.

14
00:00:49,252 --> 00:00:51,592
(Model:)I think we have satellite.

15
00:00:52,839 --> 00:00:54,839
(Howard:)That's what I meant.

16
00:00:55,008 --> 00:00:58,258
(Model:)Oh. Okay. Come on in.

17
00:01:03,391 --> 00:01:07,851
(Howard:)She's taller than all the women
in my family combined.

18
00:01:09,314 --> 00:01:10,444
(Raj:)What do we do now?

19
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:16,150
(Howard:)Follow Mrs. Wolowitz.

